 text-mlbb-text-secondary/90 sm:basis-auto sm:before:mx-1 sm:before:text-mlbb-text-secondary/50 sm:before:content-[&#x27;•&#x27;]">Use when you need to buy two seconds after landing Avatar of the Guardian and no other active equipment is in the build.</span></li></ul></div></div></article></section></div><div id="tabpanel-skins" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-skins" hidden=""></div><div id="tabpanel-lore" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-lore" hidden=""></div><div id="tabpanel-stats" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-stats" tabindex="0" hidden=""><div class="mt-6 md:mt-8"><section id="rank-stats" aria-labelledby="rank-stats-heading" class="relative bg-surface-2/85 backdrop-blur-sm border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden" style="box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.03) inset, 0 18px 38px -24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8)"><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 right-0 h-px bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-mlbb-gold-bright/55 to-transparent" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-mlbb-gold-bright/40" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-mlbb-gold/30" aria-hidden="true"></div><div class="relative p-3 sm:p-4 md:p-6"><header class="mb-4 md:mb-5"><h2 id="rank-stats-heading" class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-text-accent-bright uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight">Gatotkaca Win Rate &amp; Pick Rate by Rank</h2><p class="mt-2 text-text-muted leading-relaxed text-[13px] md:mt-3 md:text-[15px] max-w-[72ch]">Gatotkaca’s performance varies across MLBB ranked brackets. The table compares Gatotkaca’s current win rate, pick rate, and ban rate at each rank against the hero’s all-rank baseline and tracks the change over the last 7