Gatotkaca.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gatotkaca#build-exp-hybrid-dive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy Thunder Belt\",\"text\":\"Purchase Thunder Belt (1,820 gold) as item 2 in the EXP Hybrid Dive build for Gatotkaca.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gatotkaca#build-exp-hybrid-dive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Concentrated Energy\",\"text\":\"Purchase Concentrated Energy (2,020 gold) as item 3 in the EXP Hybrid Dive build for Gatotkaca.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gatotkaca#build-exp-hybrid-dive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Glowing Wand\",\"text\":\"Purchase Glowing Wand (2,050 gold) as item 4 in the EXP Hybrid Dive build for Gatotkaca.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gatotkaca#build-exp-hybrid-dive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Brute Force Breastplate\",\"text\":\"Purchase Brute Force Breastplate (1,870 gold) as item 5 in the EXP Hybrid Dive build for Gatotkaca.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gatotkaca#build-exp-hybrid-dive\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Immortality\",\"text\":\"Purchase Immortality (2,120 gold) as item 6 in the EXP Hybrid Dive build for Gatotkaca.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gatotkaca#build-exp-hybrid-dive\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/gatotkaca\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-17T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-08-02T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":41,\"name\":\"Gatotkaca\",\"slug\":\"gatotkaca\",\"title\":\"Mighty Legend\",\"role\":[\"Tank\",\"Fighter\"],\"specialty\":[\"Crowd Control\",\"Burst\"],\"lane\":[\"Roam\",\"EXP\"],\"tier\":\"D\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2017,\"stats\":{\"durability\":90,\"offense\":30,\"controlEffect\":90,\"difficulty\":40},\"winRate\":45.01,\"pickRate\":0.56,\"banRate\":0.29,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Due to his great CC and high Physical Defense, Gatotkaca counters Marksmen with no mobility skills like Layla and Popol and Kupa..\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"popol-and-kupa\",\"heroName\":\"Popol and Kupa\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Due to his great CC and high Physical Defense, Gatotkaca counters Marksmen with no mobility skills like Layla and Popol and Kupa..\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"diggie\",\"heroName\":\"Diggie\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Gatotkaca is countered by heroes that can remove CC like Diggie and Wanwan who will greatly reduce his effectiveness.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"wanwan\",\"heroName\":\"Wanwan\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Gatotkaca is countered by heroes that can remove CC like Diggie and Wanwan who will greatly reduce his effectiveness.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_a9a9551515638bb9b6128eef1ee916bd.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_96f9dbbc096e0f0a28f9b9e587d06a9c.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"36\",\"heroName\":\"Aurora\",\"heroSlug\":\"aurora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/737f20a2934bbae1c5fd1b129dcbe066.jpg?w=200-200-fefefe\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"39\",\"heroName\":\"Roger\",\"heroSlug\":\"roger\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_d2f1ce4289d7399177b7f8a25bdf593d.png\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"8\",\"heroName\":\"Karina\",\"heroSlug\":\"karina\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/1691dbbde8237768590768a90510d5a6.jpg?w=100-100-f7fcc4\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Steel Bones\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Gatotkaca gains Physical Defense equal to 2% of his lost HP (up to 200). He gains 5 Rage (up to 100) for every 300 damage taken (calculated before reduction).\\n\\nUpon reaching 25 Rage, Gatotkaca's next Basic Attack is enhanced, consuming all Rage to deal (+100% Total Physical Attack) (+200% Total Magic Power) (+ 8.2-11 * Consumed Rage) Magic Damage (scales with hero level) and recover (8 * Consumed Rage) HP.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Gatotkaca gains \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Defense\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" equal to 2% of his lost HP (up to 200). He gains 5 Rage (up to 100) for every 300 damage taken (calculated before reduction).\\n\\nUpon reaching 25 Rage, Gatotkaca's next Basic Attack is enhanced, consuming all Rage to deal \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+200% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+ 8.2-11 * \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Consumed Rage\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\") Magic Damage (scales with hero level) and recover (8 * \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Consumed Rage\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\") HP.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_2bcf1c5dea0b73298389955379bdc6b4.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\",\"Heal\"]},{\"name\":\"Blast Iron Fist\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Gatotkaca slams the ground, creating a shattered zone in the target direction while dealing 200 (+150% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to enemies within. Enemies in the shattered zone will take 100 (+20% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage per second and be slowed by 30%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Gatotkaca slams the ground, creating a shattered zone in the target direction while dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+150% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to enemies within. Enemies in the shattered zone will take 100\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+20% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage per second and be slowed by 30%.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"8s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_14b9b342dddb7cc721b7e93ba38a33ff.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Slow\"]},{\"name\":\"Unbreakable\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Gatotkaca begins channeling, then sprints in the target direction with a battle cry, taunting enemies on the path to attack him, dealing 200 (+100% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage for 0.9 - 1.5s. The taunt duration and sprint distance scale with the channel time. Canceling the skill reduces 50% of the remaining cooldown.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Gatotkaca begins channeling, then sprints in the target direction with a battle cry, taunting enemies on the path to attack him, dealing 200\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+100% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage for 0.9 - 1.5s. The taunt duration and sprint distance scale with the channel time. Canceling the skill reduces 50% of the remaining cooldown.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"12s\",\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6c888f8a9fb4daac350896e27d7f49eb.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Mobility\"]},{\"name\":\"Avatar of the Guardian\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"Gatotkaca jumps to the target location, dealing 500 (+300% Total Magic Power) Magic Damage to nearby enemies and knocking them airborne for 1s. Enemies near the center of the area will be knocked airborne for a longer duration, while enemies on the fringes will be pulled to the center.\\n\\nThe camera will move with the skill indicator but won't grant extra sight.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Gatotkaca jumps to the target location, dealing 500\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+300% Total Magic Power)\",\"color\":\"#62f8fe\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Magic Damage to nearby enemies and knocking them airborne for 1s. Enemies near the center of the area will be knocked airborne for a longer duration, while enemies on the fringes will be pulled to the center.\\n\\nThe camera will move with the skill indicator but won't grant extra sight.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_072e55d9347652eb686b7539943887de.png\",\"tags\":[\"CC\",\"Mobility\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-1-2\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Leveling skill gatot dapat disesuaikan dengan berbagai situasi. Jika Anda ingin bermain tipe Poke/Push, maka max Skill 1 terlebih dahulu. Jika Anda lebih memilih bertahan atau menyerang kembali dalam menghadapi lawan bertipe Melee, maka maksimalkan Skill 2.\\nNaikkan Ultimate bila tersedia.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Leveling skill gatot dapat disesuaikan dengan berbagai situasi. Jika Anda ingin bermain tipe Poke/Push, maka max Skill 1 terlebih dahulu. Jika Anda lebih memilih bertahan atau menyerang kembali dalam menghadapi lawan bertipe Melee, maka maksimalkan Skill 2.\"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Naikkan Ultimate bila tersedia.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"kagura\",\"heroName\":\"Kagura\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Gatotkaca works best with heroes with strong CC and damage, such as Kagura and Vale who can give his Ultimate even more value.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"vale\",\"heroName\":\"Vale\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Gatotkaca works best with heroes with strong CC and damage, such as Kagura and Vale who can give his Ultimate even more value.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, use Gatotkaca's Ultimate to dive into the enemy team, then use his 2nd Skill to taunt them, and slow them with his 1st Skill before finishing with Basic Attacks.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":4130,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_072e55d9347652eb686b7539943887de.png\"},{\"skillId\":4120,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6c888f8a9fb4daac350896e27d7f49eb.png\"},{\"skillId\":4110,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_14b9b342dddb7cc721b7e93ba38a33ff.png\"},{\"skillId\":4100,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, use Gatotkaca's 2nd Skill to CC the enemy by charging up to extend the range while aiming, then follow up with his 1st Skill and Basic Attacks.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":4120,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_6c888f8a9fb4daac350896e27d7f49eb.png\"},{\"skillId\":4110,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_14b9b342dddb7cc721b7e93ba38a33ff.png\"},{\"skillId\":4100,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_f98d2e98eaebfb31c6c5101cf1c3201a.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Gatotkaca build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. Cursed Helmet + Thunder Belt power spike, taunt timing after the 2.1.40 nerf, and when NOT to pick him.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Gatotkaca is a tank that punishes tunneling. His kit is built around one bet: the enemy team will keep attacking him after he taunts them, and he will get stronger the more they do. Break that assumption and he is a slow, escape-less statue with a telegraphed ultimate.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"gatotkaca\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-08-02\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"roam-vengeance-punish\",\"name\":\"Roam Vengeance Punish\",\"roleContext\":\"Roam\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"cursed-helmet\",\"name\":\"Cursed Helmet\",\"cost\":1910,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\",\"cost\":1820,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\",\"cost\":1860,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"cursed-helmet\",\"name\":\"Cursed Helmet\"},{\"slug\":\"thunder-belt\",\"name\":\"Thunder Belt\"},{\"slug\":\"dominance-ice\",\"name\":\"Dominance Ice\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"tank\",\"name\":\"Tank Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"vitality\",\"name\":\"Vitality\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/vitality.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"tenacity\",\"name\":\"Tenacity\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/tenacity.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"brave-smite\",\"name\":\"Brave Smite\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/brave-smite.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"vengeance\",\"name\":\"Vengeance\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"encourage\",\"name\":\"Encourage\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"athenas-shield\",\"name\":\"Athena's Shield\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when burst magic can remove you before Rage, Vengeance, and Brave Smite stabilize the engage.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"radiant-armor\",\"name\":\"Radiant Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use into repeated magic damage that keeps tagging you during Lord and mid-river fights.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"antique-cuirass\",\"name\":\"Antique Cuirass\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when physical skill burst is the main threat and Dominance Ice already covers sustain suppression.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"blade-armor\",\"name\":\"Blade Armor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"oracle\",\"name\":\"Oracle\"},\"trigger\":\"Use only when the enemy marksman must basic attack through your taunt to win fights.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default roam setup for forcing enemies to hit Gatotkaca while Cursed Helmet, Thunder Belt, Vengeance, and team buffs punish the contact.\",\"totalCost\":10420,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"hp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.hp\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":3650,\"sources\":[\"Cursed Helmet\",\"Thunder Belt\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"physdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":90,\"sources\":[\"Thunder Belt\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Oracle\",\"Immortality\"]},{\"key\":\"magicdefense\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.magicDefense\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"defensive\",\"value\":113,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Cursed Helmet\",\"Thunder Belt\",\"Dominance Ice\",\"Oracle\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeed\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":60,\"sources\":[\"Tough Boots\",\"Thunder Belt\"]},{\"key\":\"movespeedPct\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.movementSpeed\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":5,\"sources\":[\"Dominance Ice\"]},{\"key\":\"cdreduction\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.cooldownReduction\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"utility\",\"value\":10,\"sources\":[\"Oracle\"]}],\"conflicts\":[],\"simulatorUrl\":\"/build-simulator?hero=gatotkaca\u0026items=tough-boots%2Ccursed-helmet%2Cthunder-belt%2Cdominance-ice%2Coracle%2Cimmortality\u0026b