t-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Is Gatotkaca the right roam this game?\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Gatotkaca wants a second CC hero on the team. His ultimate has a visible indicator, a windup, and one of the longest cooldowns in his kit, which means a solo engage against anyone with a dash or a purify is a free dodge. Pair him with a setup hero who can freeze the fight first (Angela bind, Chou S1 flick, Mathilda pull, Xavier stun) and his ult becomes a teamfight-ender. Pair him with nothing and he becomes the tank who walks in, yells, and dies alone.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":[\"Patch 2.1.88 (\",[\"$\",\"$L40\",\"a-0\",{\"href\":\"/patch-notes\",\"prefetch\":false,\"className\":\"text-[#C8AA6E] hover:text-[#F0D060] underline decoration-[#C8AA6E]/40 hover:decoration-[#F0D060] transition-colors\",\"children\":\"patch notes\"}],\") nudged his base HP and physical defense up to keep roam tanks relevant after the roaming-attribute adjustments, so he eats the early jungle invade a little better than he used to. It changes none of the above: he still needs a partner to land the ult.\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Lock him when: your team already has hard CC and you need a body that absorbs focus fire. He is at his best protecting a hypercarry marksman like Melissa or Lesley, or front-lining for a poke mage like Pharsa who needs time to set up.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Do not lock him when: the enemy draft has Karrie, Diggie, Lunox, or Baxia. Karrie's true damage voids his entire armor-conversion identity. Diggie's ultimate makes his team CC-immune, so your taunt and ult do nothing. Lunox's Chaos ultimate is invulnerable and phases through your taunt. Baxia's passive cuts your healing and shield effects, which neuters your enhanced basic sustain. If your current draft cannot answer at least three of those four, pick someone else.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L7f\",\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\",\"\\n\",\"$L8c\",\"\\n\",\"$L8d\"],\"$L8e\",\"$L8f\"],\"$L90\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a7:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb1:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6e:[\"$\",\"$L6b\",\"kalea\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/kalea\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6c\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_4f3d4649e301c76daf20bd8811f3095c.png\",\"alt\":\"Kalea - Surging Wave\",\"unoptimized\":false,\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPriority\":\"$undefined\",\"fill\":true,\"className\":\"object-cover group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform duration-300\",\"sizes\":\"56px\",\"placeholder\":\"blur\",\"blurDataURL\":\"data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWlnaHQ9IjEwMCIgeG1sbnM9Imh0dHA6Ly93d3cudzMub3JnLzIwMDAvc3ZnIj48cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iMTAwIiBoZWl